{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the dungeon as an artifact-collecting crow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Articrow is a top-down action roguelike game about a cute crow exploring dungeons to find the ultimate artifact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect artifacts and create your own magical combinations to conquer dungeons in a charming pixel-art world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather mana to use a variety of magical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Artifacts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine skill parts to create your own powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Ways to Attack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use basic attacks to recover mana, and unleash powerful skills on your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the final boss and escape the dungeon!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start First Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832740/554f03d5a1c181761380f22222acb9e6202e781f.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorial Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832740/d82f7b995fc5ea3ef132d1703e4d6c4a9a387153.jpg"},{"name":"Slime Boss Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832740/ec7e964bf2b217ab4a0880e34ae0f445ab6dede8.jpg"},{"name":"Golem Boss Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3832740/b16923a0d290ae91602f5d773e4cd609e7b11f4d.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832740?t=1769133413","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/a